WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.400
Before erasing a shared whiteboard,

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.400
ask the meeting owner
whether the notes need saving.

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.750
Once they confirm,

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.020
erase the board from top to bottom
using the felt eraser.

5
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.700
Put the eraser and markers
back in the tray.

6
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.100
Then check the whole board
from the doorway.

7
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.780
Leave a clear surface,
ready for the next meeting.
